Feature: Umbrella Corporation Mainframe Security & Bio-Organic Weapon Verification

  Scenario: STARS Agent fails authentication on Antarctic Transport Facility (Code Veronica)
    Given Agent "Claire Redfield" attempts access to "Rockfort Terminal"
    And she inputs security passcode "VERONICA-1998"
    When the system validates credentials via endpoint "/users/999"
    Then the mainframe should respond with HTTP status 404
    And the system response should confirm access denied

  Scenario: Research Director retrieves B.O.W. status report from NEST Mainframe (RE2)
    Given Researcher "William Birkin" is authenticated on NEST Terminal
    When he requests system data for subject ID 1
    Then the mainframe should respond with HTTP status 200
    And the response body field "username" should be "Bret"